{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/凛耀•虹落锋回","pageid":9058,"revid":22177,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E8%99%B9%E8%90%BD%E9%94%8B%E5%9B%9E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E8%99%B9%E8%90%BD%E9%94%8B%E5%9B%9E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E8%99%B9%E8%90%BD%E9%94%8B%E5%9B%9E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>凛耀•虹落锋回</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.87.9B.E8.80.80.E2.80.A2.E8.99.B9.E8.90.BD.E9.94.8B.E5.9B.9E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"凛耀•虹落锋回\"><b>凛耀•虹落锋回</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 凛耀•虹落锋回.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/44/fz61ofei30ds6lhyiv9vh9t1vmaxgem.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E8%99%B9%E8%90%BD%E9%94%8B%E5%9B%9E.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/44/fz61ofei30ds6lhyiv9vh9t1vmaxgem.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E8%99%B9%E8%90%BD%E9%94%8B%E5%9B%9E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/44/fz61ofei30ds6lhyiv9vh9t1vmaxgem.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛耀•虹落锋回\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>扇形\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）技能效果与[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"凛耀•贯日长虹\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">凛耀•贯日长虹</font></span></span>]相同。<br />✦释放后，技能还原为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"凛耀•贯日长虹\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">凛耀•贯日长虹</font></span></span>]，并使其冷却回合数加<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>。<br />✦若不释放，技能在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"凛耀•贯日长虹\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">凛耀•贯日长虹</font></span></span>]冷却回合为<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>时还原。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5 扇形.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/cxkj07hr01eqbiw50gmuqm2fjzprmho.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E6%89%87%E5%BD%A2.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"78\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/cxkj07hr01eqbiw50gmuqm2fjzprmho.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E6%89%87%E5%BD%A2.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/cxkj07hr01eqbiw50gmuqm2fjzprmho.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5_%E6%89%87%E5%BD%A2.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"201\" data-file-height=\"195\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%84%E5%A5%A5%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/狄奥娜\"><img alt=\"头像 狄奥娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/69/3k01hs8h1x90i6tejnl6yrh46nftbx7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">狄奥娜</font></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content